   "end": 19.291,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "But nothing up there/ takes a week.",
     "start": 17.561,
     "end": 19.291
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Historians trace the number to Babylon, and its 7 moving lights.",
